    "summary": "fred-unrate-clone Clone of the FRED Unemployment Rate (UNRATE) series detail page. Pages | File | Purpose | | --- | --- | | `index.html` | UNRATE series page: top FRED nav + series title / subtitle; main chart (line + recession-period shading + hover tooltip); time-range toggles above the chart (5Y / 10Y / Max) + frequency (Monthly / Quarterly / Annual) + unit toggle; metadata block on the right / below (Source, Release, Units, Frequency, Last updated, Notes); Download / API / Embed / Citation actions; related-series recommendations | | `data.js` | Historical UNRATE monthly time series (mock) | | `styles.css` | FRED palette (blue-gray), chart, metadata table, button groups |",
